1
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:44,159
That's a lot of money.

2
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,560
It's no small matter.

3
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:51,599
Are you sure they have President Dan?

4
00:01:51,599 --> 00:01:52,359
I'm sure.

5
00:01:53,079 --> 00:01:53,599
No.

6
00:01:54,599 --> 00:01:55,560
I need to think about this.

7
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:57,280
Shouldn't we report this to headquarters?

8
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,319
I'll handle this.

9
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:00,680
Of course you have to handle it.

10
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,159
As head of security for the hotel

11
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:05,280
and President Dan's personal bodyguard,

12
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:07,040
now that something's happened to her,

13
00:02:07,079 --> 00:02:08,240
it's a dereliction of your duty.

14
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:10,520
You have to take responsibility.

15
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,000
If we don't report it to headquarters,

16
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,560
then we'll rescue President Dan together.

17
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,879
Rescue her? Easy for you to say. How?

18
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,639
This is all the money I have.

19
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:26,039
How about adding a bottle of wine?

20
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,520
You're so gorgeous.

21
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,000
Come here and let me look at you, baby.

22
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:53,400
Someone from Plato Hotel was kidnapped.

23
00:02:53,439 --> 00:02:54,680
Do you have any leads?

24
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,639
No, but I heard

25
00:02:58,919 --> 00:03:00,759
Kwame, the boss of Bituo Company,

26
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,800
has already moved against Plato Hotel.

27
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:04,199
Could it be them?

28
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,520
We already checked.

29
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,560
It wasn't them.

30
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:12,840
Okay, I'll have Nash ask around again,

31
00:03:13,319 --> 00:03:14,919
see if there's any info,

32
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:15,840
and let you know.

33
00:03:16,919 --> 00:03:18,120
Preferably before tonight.

34
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:20,560
Is this person that important?

35
00:03:22,479 --> 00:03:23,960
We must ensure her safety.

36
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:28,639
Just a heads-up,

37
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,599
go look for someone named Black Cat.

38
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,360
Maybe he'll know something.

39
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:39,759
Is the money ready?

40
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:42,319
It's ready.

41
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:43,639
Who are you?

42
00:03:44,039 --> 00:03:45,439
I'm the one bringing you the money.

43
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,919
Don't pull any tricks,

44
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:48,680
or I'll kill her.

45
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:51,840
Put our person on the phone.

46
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:54,159
I want to hear that she's safe.

47
00:03:58,199 --> 00:04:00,080
Anda? Is that Anda?

48
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,680
President Dan, it's Xiang Lai.

49
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:04,000
Listen to me.

50
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,759
Listen carefully.

51
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:06,240
You have to keep yourself safe.

52
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,400
Wait for us to get you out.

53
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:10,080
Xiang Lai! Xiang Lai, save me!

54
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:13,039
Tonight at eight o'clock,

55
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,680
in the alley on Blue Street in Shawan.

56
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,560
All right.

57
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:21,040
Money for the hostage.

58
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,040
You must guarantee her safety.

59
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,000
Remember, don't call the police,

60
00:04:26,439 --> 00:04:28,680
or I'll kill her.

61
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,600
We don't have much time left.

62
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,399
In such a short time,

63
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:47,439
how are we going to find that much money?

64
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:50,560
Don't worry. We'll find a way.

65
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,240
Wait here for me. I'm heading out.

66
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,959
Tonight at eight o'clock,

67
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:05,079
cash for the hostage.

68
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,600
Anda, give me your phone, quick.

69
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:13,600
I need to check your call log with the kidnappers.

70
00:05:16,319 --> 00:05:17,720
When the kidnappers call again,

71
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,399
we must trace their location.

72
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,279
Pinpointing their exact location

73
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:23,720
will take about two minutes.

74
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:24,639
So you need to

75
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,839
keep them on the line as long as you can, okay?

76
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,319
There's no word from Grace either.

77
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:48,279
Though she did provide a lead.

78
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,439
Looks like things aren't that simple.

79
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,000
That's all I've got.

80
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:55,680
All right, we'll talk later.

81
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,480
I did my best.

82
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,639
If we rescue President Dan like this,

83
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,839
will she even know?

84
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:04,000
Yang Di, Yang Di...

85
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:06,279
We're helping a friend in a pinch, being selfless.

86
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:08,079
What are you thinking? Honestly.

87
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:10,279
Don't you agree, Mr. Wei?

88
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,920
I hope President Dan comes back safely.

89
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:29,600
Let's go withdraw the cash in a bit.

90
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,480
Be careful.

91
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:34,839
Is that enough money? If not, use this.

92
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:37,959
Xiang Lai, the kidnappers demanded cash.

93
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,000
We're short on cash. This is all of it.

94
00:06:41,439 --> 00:06:42,560
You two go together.

95
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,399
It's safer that way.

96
00:07:05,879 --> 00:07:07,759
Excuse me, do you know where Black Cat is?

97
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:08,959
I don't know.

98
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,360
Hello.

99
00:07:19,399 --> 00:07:20,600
I want to see Black Cat.

100
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,800
I'm Black Cat.

101
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:24,480
You could only be White Cat.

102
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,199
Let him in.

103
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,839
You guys step outside.

104
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:37,800
Right, right, okay.

105
00:07:44,399 --> 00:07:46,759
How did you know that guy wasn't me?

106
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:51,360
Because Grace sent me.

107
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,759
She told me to look for you here.

108
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,800
Second,

109
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:59,480
one look in your eyes tells me who Black Cat is.

110
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,560
Third, she told me

111
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:02,959
only you could tell me

112
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,319
who exactly

113
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:06,439
kidnapped the Plato Hotel staff.

114
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,759
With some things,

115
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:17,199
what you see isn't necessarily the truth.

116
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,680
If the ransom you're about to pay

117
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,800
gets intercepted,

118
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:27,439
tell me, what would you do?

119
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,440
Xiang Lai? Where are you?

120
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,360
At the bank.

121
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:46,919
Check the front entrance.

122
00:08:47,279 --> 00:08:48,399
See any suspicious people?

123
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:56,799
Yes.

124
00:08:57,320 --> 00:09:00,440
Okay. Grab the cash and leave through the back door.

125
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:00,960
Be careful.

126
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:01,960
Okay, got it.

127
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,519
Let's go.

128
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:09,080
Thanks, Black Cat.

129
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:12,720
I owe you one.

130
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:19,240
Give me the bag.

131
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:20,200
Here.

132
00:10:00,759 --> 00:10:02,440
Did you get a call from the kidnappers today?

133
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,759
No.

134
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:06,799
I keep feeling like a pair of eyes

135
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:07,799
is watching us.

136
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:10,159
He can see our every move.

137
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:26,559
Tonight's operation is canceled.

138
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,600
Then when is it rescheduled for?

139
00:10:38,919 --> 00:10:40,039
Did you find the location?

140
00:10:41,879 --> 00:10:42,919
There wasn't enough time.

141
00:11:24,759 --> 00:11:25,799
Did you want to see me?

142
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:28,399
Let's go.

143
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:30,519
Let's take a walk outside.

144
00:11:33,519 --> 00:11:34,320
Come on.

145
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,200
What is it?

146
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,919
Did President Dan get any updates?

147
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:42,879
No.

148
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:46,399
Here, take this.

149
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,720
What do I need this for?

150
00:11:50,639 --> 00:11:52,279
Since there might be danger,

151
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,799
we need to be prepared.

152
00:11:54,639 --> 00:11:56,080
But isn't this

153
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,360
a tribal ornament?

154
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,919
What good is it to me?

155
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:03,200
It's a tribal medal of bravery.

156
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,000
Only a true warrior

157
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,559
deserves this medal.

158
00:12:07,639 --> 00:12:08,440
Here.

159
00:12:10,519 --> 00:12:12,440
So you think I'm brave,

160
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,840
like a warrior?

161
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:15,679
It's because there's a GPS inside.

162
00:12:15,919 --> 00:12:16,840
If anything happens,

163
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,000
we can protect you.

164
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,960
Is the money ready?

165
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,759
It is. Where is our person?

166
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:32,639
Today at noon, Red Building Square.

167
00:12:32,919 --> 00:12:34,120
Bring the money.

168
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:37,320
First, confirm our hostage is safe.

169
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:47,080
Noon. Red Building Square.

170
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,960
The target has entered Red Building Square.

171
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,320
There's a trash can behind you.

172
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,679
Put the money inside, and you can leave.

173
00:13:45,639 --> 00:13:46,519
Where's our person?

174
00:13:46,559 --> 00:13:47,840
Once I get the money,

175
00:13:48,039 --> 00:13:49,360
I'll let her go.

176
00:14:24,799 --> 00:14:27,600
The money is in place. Stay sharp.

177
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,559
Three o'clock is clear.

178
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,879
Eight o'clock is clear.

179
00:15:23,679 --> 00:15:25,440
Someone's approaching at one o'clock.

180
00:15:55,279 --> 00:15:56,360
He's just a scavenger.

181
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:08,960
The deal's off.

182
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:20,799
What should we do?

183
00:16:21,279 --> 00:16:23,080
It's been over 24 hours already.

184
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:25,919
What if... what if something happened to her?

185
00:16:26,159 --> 00:16:28,080
She might be a She-devil,

186
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,200
but she's still a woman.

187
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:29,960
For someone like her,

188
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:32,080
every passing second is pure torture.

189
00:16:32,919 --> 00:16:34,080
She's actually a decent person,

190
00:16:34,759 --> 00:16:36,320
she just tends to be hard on people.

191
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:38,000
Wei Tian.

192
00:16:38,279 --> 00:16:40,320
I traced the kidnapper's phone signal.

193
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:41,960
We found the target.

194
00:16:43,679 --> 00:16:44,279
Let's move.

195
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,039
They've found out.

196
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,160
What did you find?

197
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:25,759
It's the militants

198
00:18:25,759 --> 00:18:27,240
Anda crossed before.

199
00:18:28,039 --> 00:18:30,519
Looks like her enemies have come knocking again.

200
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:34,720
I can't shake the feeling that something's off.

201
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,079
Do you have a location?

202
00:18:37,559 --> 00:18:38,759
I'll send you the address.

203
00:18:39,079 --> 00:18:39,359
Okay.

204
00:18:53,359 --> 00:18:54,559
You two head back first.

205
00:18:54,559 --> 00:18:55,359
Where are you going?

206
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,920
Rossi already gave me a lead.

207
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,240
I'm coming too.

208
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,440
Danfeng is under Zhong'an's protection too.

209
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,400
I have to go.

210
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,279
I'm going as well.

211
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,759
No need. I can handle it myself.

212
00:19:06,039 --> 00:19:07,079
No, um...

213
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:08,759
You can't go.

214
00:19:09,599 --> 00:19:11,680
I'll just watch from a distance.

215
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:14,720
Just go back to the hotel. Be good.

216
00:19:25,519 --> 00:19:26,640
The signal is connected.

217
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:27,680
Now we can hear

218
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,279
the call between Wei Tian and Xiang Lai.

219
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:35,920
Sister Luo Xi, don't worry.

220
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:37,039
Everything is in place.

221
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:55,240
We're nine kilometers from the mission objective.

222
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:56,920
Eight kilometers from the protected target.

223
00:20:11,839 --> 00:20:13,480
Are you sure you want to keep going like this?

224
00:20:14,599 --> 00:20:17,480
We might die, but stopping will kill us too.

225
00:20:45,519 --> 00:20:46,920
Put down your guns. Lower them.

226
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:53,680
Who was firing blindly just now?

227
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:57,119
Can't you see the Silent Protectors have a new member?

228
00:20:58,279 --> 00:20:59,720
I'm Xiang Lai from Zhong'an Group.

229
00:20:59,839 --> 00:21:00,839
I'm not a Silent Protector.

230
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:08,759
Lower your guns. Play nice. Hurry up.

231
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,599
Everyone, put your weapons down.

232
00:21:11,799 --> 00:21:13,119
If you still don't release them,

233
00:21:13,119 --> 00:21:14,319
it's going to be a race.

234
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:18,079
MK2 grenade.

235
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:19,920
A four to 4.8-second delay.

236
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,000
Can we make it out?

237
00:21:22,359 --> 00:21:24,720
Three seconds, barely.

238
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:30,960
But they still have six guns.

239
00:21:31,079 --> 00:21:32,559
They can drop us in a second.

240
00:21:56,079 --> 00:21:59,119
If we wait five more seconds,

241
00:21:59,599 --> 00:22:01,000
all that'll be left here

242
00:22:01,599 --> 00:22:03,240
is you, me,

243
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:05,920
and you.

244
00:22:06,359 --> 00:22:08,160
Stop shooting! Listen to me!

245
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:12,240
Someone paid me to snatch them.

246
00:22:13,880 --> 00:22:16,039
This time, you Silent Protectors and I

247
00:22:16,599 --> 00:22:17,640
are no different.

248
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:19,359
I'm just doing a job for a client.

249
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:21,200
I don't know anything else.

250
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,440
The ransom was just me trying

251
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:25,079
to make some extra cash. Forget the money.

252
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:27,440
You can take them with you.

253
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:28,640
Let them go.

254
00:22:43,839 --> 00:22:44,640
Captain,

255
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:45,920
during this mission,

256
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:47,599
how many apples did you eat?

257
00:22:48,319 --> 00:22:50,039
All I kept hearing was you crunching,

258
00:22:50,039 --> 00:22:51,240
biting into those apples.

259
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:52,960
Wrong.

260
00:22:53,599 --> 00:22:54,599
It was a pear.

261
00:22:55,279 --> 00:22:56,359
I ran out of apples.

262
00:22:58,359 --> 00:22:59,480
How far are you from me?

263
00:23:00,079 --> 00:23:00,799
Captain,

264
00:23:00,799 --> 00:23:02,839
we Silent Protectors have rules.

265
00:23:03,319 --> 00:23:05,880
We stay about eight kilometers from the target.

266
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:08,160
I think you'd better just walk back.

267
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:11,119
Can't you be a little flexible?

268
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:13,759
Close in on me. Five kilometers.

269
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:14,920
Come pick me up.

270
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,440
Five kilometers.

271
00:24:16,480 --> 00:24:17,279
Anda.

272
00:24:18,119 --> 00:24:18,599
Thank you.

273
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:37,759
Across this land,

274
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:40,319
peace and beauty grow like wild grass.

275
00:24:40,319 --> 00:24:41,119
Our mission

276
00:24:42,039 --> 00:24:43,599
is to protect this beauty.

277
00:24:48,440 --> 00:24:49,279
We believe

278
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:51,599
this is also every African's

279
00:24:51,599 --> 00:24:52,559
shared dream.

280
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:10,759
The best is yet to come, Wei Tian.

281
00:25:25,319 --> 00:25:26,799
Anda, wake up.

282
00:25:26,799 --> 00:25:27,559
What is it?

283
00:25:27,839 --> 00:25:28,599
Mr. Dan is looking for you.

284
00:25:29,440 --> 00:25:29,759
Come on,

285
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:31,279
wh-what time is it even?

286
00:25:31,279 --> 00:25:32,599
Why... why is it always something?

287
00:25:33,119 --> 00:25:34,440
I'm just the messenger.

288
00:25:34,480 --> 00:25:35,319
Hurry up.

289
00:25:35,640 --> 00:25:36,160
That's all.

290
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:37,559
Okay.

291
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:49,839
Hold on.

292
00:25:50,319 --> 00:25:50,920
What is it?

293
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:54,279
The She-devil is back at full strength.

294
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,599
Anda, take a seat.

295
00:26:22,079 --> 00:26:23,359
What... What is this?

296
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:24,559
When I was kidnapped this time,

297
00:26:24,559 --> 00:26:26,039
you went out of your way to rescue me.

298
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:28,319
I'll never forget your kindness.

299
00:26:29,039 --> 00:26:30,599
It's just a small gift. Please take it.

300
00:26:31,039 --> 00:26:33,119
How... How could I possibly accept this?

301
00:26:33,279 --> 00:26:34,920
Just take it.

302
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,519
When no one else is around,

303
00:26:37,119 --> 00:26:38,400
just call me Danfeng.

304
00:26:39,079 --> 00:26:40,200
Thank you, Sister Danfeng.

305
00:26:41,759 --> 00:26:43,960
Still, there's something

306
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:45,240
I'd like to ask you about.

307
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:47,000
Go ahead.

308
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:49,000
The guy who rescued me last time...

309
00:26:49,279 --> 00:26:49,960
Are you close with him?

310
00:26:51,759 --> 00:26:53,400
Pretty close, I guess.

311
00:26:54,119 --> 00:26:56,079
What does he usually like to do?

312
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,839
He doesn't really have any hobbies.

313
00:27:01,839 --> 00:27:03,400
He's quite a boring person.

314
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:05,799
Tell me,

315
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:08,359
if I had a boyfriend like him,

316
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:10,519
wouldn't I have nothing to fear?

317
00:27:13,079 --> 00:27:14,880
How well do you actually know him?

318
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:17,400
I mean, what's his relationship status?

319
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:18,440
Does he have a girlfriend?

320
00:27:21,319 --> 00:27:23,880
I only know he was married before.

321
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:26,079
And because of something that happened,

322
00:27:26,079 --> 00:27:27,759
his wife and daughter passed away.

323
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:31,279
He's so young, why did he marry so early?

324
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:35,000
Being in his forties isn't young, is it?

325
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:38,599
What? You're saying Xiang Lai is in his forties?

326
00:27:39,720 --> 00:27:40,839
Oh my God.

327
00:27:41,559 --> 00:27:43,720
Wait, how does he keep looking so youthful?

328
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:45,839
You meant Xiang Lai?

329
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:49,359
Who else did you think I was talking about?

330
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:52,039
No one.

331
00:27:54,039 --> 00:27:55,119
Don't tell me

332
00:27:55,559 --> 00:27:57,039
you thought I meant Wei Tian?

333
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:02,000
Wei Tian?

334
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:06,279
Wei Tian is handsome, sure,

335
00:28:06,599 --> 00:28:08,240
but he's not my type.

336
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:14,039
As for me, I prefer someone like Xiang Lai.

337
00:28:15,759 --> 00:28:17,119
Xiang Lai is great.

338
00:28:18,079 --> 00:28:18,880
Tell me though...

339
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:21,640
Are you sure nothing happened between you two?

340
00:28:22,079 --> 00:28:23,039
Definitely not.

341
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:25,319
You really don't like him?

342
00:28:26,759 --> 00:28:29,079
He's not my type.

343
00:28:29,079 --> 00:28:30,359
I like the kind who's...

344
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:31,960
the kind who's...

345
00:28:33,799 --> 00:28:34,880
cool... super cool.

346
00:28:37,359 --> 00:28:40,440
So that means you like Wei Tian?

347
00:28:42,640 --> 00:28:45,079
N-No, no, no, I don't!

348
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:45,920
Perfect.

349
00:28:50,039 --> 00:28:51,359
Is Zhong'an treating us,

350
00:28:51,359 --> 00:28:53,039
or is this on your own dime?

351
00:28:54,359 --> 00:28:55,359
My treat, of course.

352
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:57,119
Thanks to all of you for the rescue.

353
00:29:00,519 --> 00:29:01,119
Thank you.

354
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:08,240
Mr. Xiang, someone from Plato Hotel is here to see you.

355
00:29:08,799 --> 00:29:10,400
To see me? What's this about?

356
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:12,359
Good news, of course.

357
00:29:14,279 --> 00:29:15,839
I'm heading back to China soon,

358
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:18,279
while you guys have to keep working hard here.

359
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:19,319
Thank you for your hard work.

360
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:24,920
Sorry, everyone. We're late.

361
00:29:26,319 --> 00:29:27,759
Let me make a formal introduction.

362
00:29:27,759 --> 00:29:29,319
This is my colleague, Shen Yu.

363
00:29:29,319 --> 00:29:31,000
Hello, everyone. Welcome!

364
00:29:31,799 --> 00:29:32,599
Hello.

365
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:34,400
The reason we're here today

366
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:37,319
is on behalf of the hotel and President Dan

367
00:29:38,200 --> 00:29:39,799
to thank Zhong'an Group.

368
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,440
We were just doing our job.

369
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:44,200
Besides, we can't take all the credit.

370
00:29:45,039 --> 00:29:45,720
Nan Sheng.

371
00:29:46,119 --> 00:29:47,839
Bring over the banner we prepared,

372
00:29:47,839 --> 00:29:48,559
and present it to Xiang Lai.

373
00:29:52,599 --> 00:29:53,160
Xiang Lai.

374
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:56,039
For your heroic rescue,

375
00:29:56,079 --> 00:29:57,400
I want to express my heartfelt thanks.

376
00:29:58,680 --> 00:29:59,319
President Dan,

377
00:29:59,319 --> 00:30:01,039
we'll definitely treasure this.

378
00:30:02,279 --> 00:30:04,400
Treasure it? Why not hang it up?

379
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:05,000
If we don't,

380
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:06,799
how could we honor President Dan's kind gesture?

381
00:30:07,759 --> 00:30:08,319
Right, absolutely.

382
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:09,160
Shen Yu.

383
00:30:09,559 --> 00:30:11,319
Hang it in the most prominent spot in our honor room.

384
00:30:11,559 --> 00:30:11,920
Got it.

385
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:14,319
Xiang Lai.

386
00:30:14,720 --> 00:30:16,960
This is actually just a small token of my appreciation.

387
00:30:17,119 --> 00:30:18,799
I have another gift for you.

388
00:30:19,359 --> 00:30:21,319
I've decided to propose to the board

389
00:30:21,599 --> 00:30:23,720
that all security operations for our hotel

390
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:25,240
be handed over to Zhong'an.

391
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:27,200
Really?

392
00:30:27,839 --> 00:30:29,000
It's through this incident

393
00:30:29,039 --> 00:30:29,839
that I finally realized

394
00:30:29,880 --> 00:30:30,720
how tough it is

395
00:30:30,759 --> 00:30:31,640
for us working overseas,

396
00:30:31,680 --> 00:30:32,599
and how dangerous it can be.

397
00:30:33,119 --> 00:30:34,559
So I'm especially grateful to you.

398
00:30:35,240 --> 00:30:36,039
And I also hope

399
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,880
we'll have more chances to get to know each other.

400
00:30:41,359 --> 00:30:42,279
Don't worry, President Dan.

401
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:44,200
We'll have all the company files on Zhong'an

402
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:45,039
delivered to you right away,

403
00:30:45,279 --> 00:30:46,000
so you can get to know us better.

404
00:31:01,559 --> 00:31:03,000
Xiang Lai, Zhong'an Group Africa Branch,

405
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:03,839
reporting to you.

406
00:31:04,119 --> 00:31:04,759
"Reporting"?

407
00:31:06,279 --> 00:31:08,440
If someone hadn't called me,

408
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:11,039
I'd still be kept in the dark!

409
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:12,880
Quite full of yourself now, huh?

410
00:31:13,279 --> 00:31:15,079
You're even keeping secrets from me!

411
00:31:15,359 --> 00:31:16,279
Time was running out,

412
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:18,160
so special measures had to be taken.

413
00:31:18,319 --> 00:31:19,400
Is that your excuse

414
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:21,039
for hiding the client's kidnapping?

415
00:31:22,279 --> 00:31:23,759
Completely undisciplined!

416
00:31:24,039 --> 00:31:25,440
If this were on a battlefield,

417
00:31:26,359 --> 00:31:27,480
I'd have you shot!

418
00:31:29,039 --> 00:31:29,599
Mr. Xiang,

419
00:31:30,640 --> 00:31:32,359
the Africa branch accepts your criticism.

420
00:31:33,119 --> 00:31:34,359
If there's to be punishment,

421
00:31:34,599 --> 00:31:35,759
please punish only me.

422
00:31:36,400 --> 00:31:37,279
This operation

423
00:31:37,359 --> 00:31:39,000
was carried out in my own name.

424
00:31:39,559 --> 00:31:41,000
I don't want to drag down the others.

425
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:44,400
You won't escape punishment. Just wait.

426
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:46,000
Yes, sir.

427
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:47,960
But Mr. Xiang,

428
00:31:48,559 --> 00:31:49,440
if not for the cooperation

429
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:50,839
of the Silent Protectors team,

430
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:52,599
things could have gone far worse.

431
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:55,359
The security situation in Antilocaris

432
00:31:55,559 --> 00:31:57,240
is indeed worse than I imagined.

433
00:31:57,559 --> 00:31:58,359
So,

434
00:31:58,519 --> 00:32:00,920
to escort China's high-speed rail experts,

435
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:02,359
we must be fully prepared.

436
00:32:02,759 --> 00:32:03,839
Our Zhong'an Group

437
00:32:03,839 --> 00:32:05,759
is unfamiliar with local African affairs,

438
00:32:05,759 --> 00:32:08,519
so you must coordinate with Silent Protectors and Bituo,

439
00:32:09,079 --> 00:32:11,279
communicating actively and cooperating closely.

440
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:12,279
Understood?

441
00:32:12,279 --> 00:32:13,079
Understood.

442
00:32:13,440 --> 00:32:14,440
Write a report

443
00:32:14,680 --> 00:32:16,079
on Antilocaris's

444
00:32:16,079 --> 00:32:17,440
current security industry,

445
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:18,240
as well as a detailed analysis

446
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:20,279
of our strengths and weaknesses.

447
00:32:20,440 --> 00:32:21,240
Yes, sir.

448
00:32:23,519 --> 00:32:24,319
Old friend...

449
00:32:25,680 --> 00:32:26,759
After all these years,

450
00:32:29,319 --> 00:32:30,960
we're finally going to meet.

451
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:00,799
Let's go.

452
00:33:15,319 --> 00:33:16,839
I know the pain in your heart

453
00:33:17,839 --> 00:33:18,759
won't easily fade.

454
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:22,200
Some things, some people...

455
00:33:23,279 --> 00:33:25,039
aren't easily forgotten.

456
00:33:33,799 --> 00:33:35,039
Let me propose a toast to everyone.

457
00:33:36,359 --> 00:33:38,079
For Plato Hotel to make it this far...

458
00:33:38,079 --> 00:33:39,319
hasn't been easy at all.

459
00:33:39,440 --> 00:33:41,039
If not for all your efforts,

460
00:33:41,079 --> 00:33:42,799
we wouldn't have made it to this day.

461
00:33:42,799 --> 00:33:43,960
So, thank you, everyone.

462
00:33:46,240 --> 00:33:47,920
We couldn't do without a single one of you.

463
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:49,119
Anda is right.

464
00:33:49,720 --> 00:33:51,960
It seems Silent Protectors and Zhong'an Group

465
00:33:51,960 --> 00:33:53,799
will have many more chances to collaborate.

466
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:57,160
Corporate partnerships are just like dating.

467
00:33:57,359 --> 00:33:58,519
It's actually quite complicated.

468
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:01,359
How can they be the same?

469
00:34:01,559 --> 00:34:03,519
Dating is about feelings,

470
00:34:03,599 --> 00:34:06,319
but partnership is about stakes and interests.

471
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:09,400
Hearing you put it that way,

472
00:34:09,639 --> 00:34:11,519
it actually makes some sense.

473
00:34:12,199 --> 00:34:12,880
Then again,

474
00:34:14,119 --> 00:34:16,159
dating is strictly between two people.

475
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,199
A love triangle...

476
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:20,280
is definitely frowned upon.

477
00:34:20,559 --> 00:34:23,360
A three-way partnership is great. It's solid.

478
00:34:24,480 --> 00:34:26,239
I think for such an important moment,

479
00:34:26,320 --> 00:34:27,960
we should take a photo as a souvenir.

480
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:28,559
What do you say?

481
00:34:29,360 --> 00:34:30,639
All right, all right, forget the photo.

482
00:34:30,920 --> 00:34:33,000
Serve the food, we're all starving.

483
00:34:33,079 --> 00:34:33,719
Hurry up, hurry up.

484
00:34:34,119 --> 00:34:35,039
Fine, let's eat first.

485
00:34:35,039 --> 00:34:36,199
We'll take pictures after we finish.

486
00:34:45,800 --> 00:34:47,400
Song Xue.

487
00:34:50,639 --> 00:34:52,119
You have a lovely name.

488
00:34:52,920 --> 00:34:53,960
Just like you.

489
00:34:54,719 --> 00:34:55,519
Very nice.

490
00:34:56,199 --> 00:34:59,320
I hear you've been the head office's

491
00:34:59,320 --> 00:35:01,320
Star Employee three years in a row.

492
00:35:01,840 --> 00:35:03,280
And you also have a talent

493
00:35:03,599 --> 00:35:04,800
for singing and dancing.

494
00:35:06,519 --> 00:35:07,400
When I was young,

495
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:09,320
I did study folk dance for five years,

496
00:35:09,559 --> 00:35:11,400
and I really enjoy singing too.

497
00:35:11,519 --> 00:35:13,039
So at the head office parties,

498
00:35:13,039 --> 00:35:14,480
I was usually the solo singer.

499
00:35:16,159 --> 00:35:16,960
Great.

500
00:35:17,199 --> 00:35:19,639
That's just the kind of employee our hotel needs.

501
00:35:20,719 --> 00:35:22,719
Still, well...

502
00:35:22,880 --> 00:35:24,960
this place is Antilocaris, after all.

503
00:35:25,400 --> 00:35:26,199
It's Africa.

504
00:35:26,199 --> 00:35:28,719
The holiday vibe here

505
00:35:28,719 --> 00:35:29,599
is nothing like back home.

506
00:35:29,599 --> 00:35:30,599
So those talents of yours

507
00:35:30,599 --> 00:35:31,639
might not be of much use.

508
00:35:32,039 --> 00:35:32,960
But one thing is certain:

509
00:35:32,960 --> 00:35:33,480
here,

510
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:35,360
you have to take your job seriously.

511
00:35:35,559 --> 00:35:37,519
What matters most is driving our performance up.

512
00:35:37,559 --> 00:35:38,480
That's crucial.

513
00:35:38,599 --> 00:35:39,480
Yes, Mr. Xiao.

514
00:35:39,639 --> 00:35:41,599
I'll also be sure to learn from Senior An Da

515
00:35:41,679 --> 00:35:42,519
and work hard.

516
00:35:43,360 --> 00:35:44,960
What is there to learn from An Da?

517
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:45,480
That An Da,

518
00:35:45,480 --> 00:35:46,920
she causes so much trouble every day.

519
00:35:46,960 --> 00:35:48,360
The messes she's made for my hotel!

520
00:35:48,360 --> 00:35:49,719
I was always the one cleaning up after her.

521
00:35:49,760 --> 00:35:50,360
Let me tell you,

522
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:54,239
if you want to learn, learn from me, Mr. Xiao.

523
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,960
I've been working here for over three years.

524
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,119
Whether it's work experience

525
00:35:58,119 --> 00:35:59,360
or life wisdom,

526
00:35:59,360 --> 00:36:01,719
there's plenty you can learn from me.

527
00:36:01,719 --> 00:36:02,119
Yes, sir.

528
00:36:02,119 --> 00:36:03,320
So if there's anything you don't understand,

529
00:36:03,320 --> 00:36:04,920
just come ask me, all right?

530
00:36:05,719 --> 00:36:06,559
Yes, Mr. Xiao.

531
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,239
A spotted deer?

532
00:36:11,079 --> 00:36:12,000
What the heck is this?

533
00:36:12,159 --> 00:36:13,320
Mine is a bear.

534
00:36:14,559 --> 00:36:15,000
Not bad.

535
00:36:17,320 --> 00:36:17,840
You know,

536
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:19,960
the Inuits

537
00:36:20,039 --> 00:36:22,880
believe their ancestors were bears.

538
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:25,880
Turns out An Da's craftwork is pretty good.

539
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:26,840
Mine is a cat.

540
00:36:27,920 --> 00:36:28,719
An Da,

541
00:36:28,920 --> 00:36:30,000
you made a badge

542
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:31,159
for each of us.

543
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:32,480
Do these different animals

544
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:33,960
have different meanings?

545
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:38,679
Uncle Qu is like a bear, powerful and strong.

546
00:36:39,519 --> 00:36:41,719
Sister Luo Xi is like a cat,

547
00:36:41,760 --> 00:36:43,199
very elegant and pretty.

548
00:36:43,719 --> 00:36:45,480
As for Sha Lan, she's like a little deer,

549
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:46,320
so adorable.

550
00:36:46,840 --> 00:36:47,639
Thanks.

551
00:36:49,199 --> 00:36:50,599
Even Sha Lan said thanks!

552
00:36:52,760 --> 00:36:53,639
I like cats.

553
00:36:54,679 --> 00:36:55,880
In the dead of night,

554
00:36:56,159 --> 00:36:57,760
they can see everything clearly.

555
00:36:58,440 --> 00:36:59,960
Nothing escapes their sight.

556
00:37:01,840 --> 00:37:03,679
Oh right, I just remembered.

557
00:37:04,079 --> 00:37:05,199
I think

558
00:37:05,760 --> 00:37:08,760
I once almost killed a bear.

559
00:37:09,400 --> 00:37:11,000
Yeah, in Moscow.

560
00:37:11,599 --> 00:37:13,800
Captain, here you go again.

561
00:37:15,079 --> 00:37:16,679
Why doesn't anyone believe me?

562
00:37:16,719 --> 00:37:18,079
An Da, do you believe me?

563
00:37:18,119 --> 00:37:19,039
Captain, I believe you.

564
00:37:33,199 --> 00:37:33,920
What is it?

565
00:37:35,920 --> 00:37:36,639
This is for you.

566
00:37:41,360 --> 00:37:42,440
Am I really that fierce?

567
00:37:43,599 --> 00:37:45,800
Harming living creatures doesn't sound like you.

568
00:37:47,360 --> 00:37:48,960
Eagles are the masters of the sky.

569
00:37:50,079 --> 00:37:51,360
I'm not that domineering.

570
00:37:52,840 --> 00:37:54,679
Yet it always has this

571
00:37:54,719 --> 00:37:56,400
aloof air about it.

572
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:59,119
It has weaknesses too.

573
00:37:59,119 --> 00:38:00,280
Do you have weaknesses?

574
00:38:00,280 --> 00:38:01,079
I do.

575
00:38:01,559 --> 00:38:03,000
I do, you do...

576
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:04,239
everyone does.

577
00:38:06,239 --> 00:38:07,320
Yet you always seem

578
00:38:07,320 --> 00:38:09,360
completely fearless when saving people.

579
00:38:12,039 --> 00:38:14,559
What scares me most is rescuing people.

580
00:38:15,440 --> 00:38:16,239
Why?

581
00:38:16,559 --> 00:38:18,119
The more you want to protect someone,

582
00:38:18,599 --> 00:38:19,440
the higher the chance

583
00:38:19,440 --> 00:38:21,719
they'll end up getting hurt.

584
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:27,480
I don't know about others, but

585
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:30,480
you have to protect me.

586
00:38:31,039 --> 00:38:33,360
Not protecting me would hurt me the most.

587
00:38:35,159 --> 00:38:36,039
Here, take this.

588
00:38:40,920 --> 00:38:41,719
We're even.

589
00:38:42,639 --> 00:38:43,440
Even.

590
00:38:47,119 --> 00:38:48,679
Confirm their security needs first,

591
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:50,119
then make adjustments accordingly.

592
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:53,320
Who's there?

593
00:38:59,159 --> 00:39:01,320
Dad? What are you doing here?

594
00:39:02,360 --> 00:39:04,400
Just checking on your vigilance.

595
00:39:05,400 --> 00:39:05,920
Dad,

596
00:39:06,639 --> 00:39:08,559
I'm a former professional soldier.

597
00:39:08,760 --> 00:39:10,119
Do you really need to question that?

598
00:39:10,119 --> 00:39:11,559
Then how did I get in?

599
00:39:12,519 --> 00:39:13,199
You...

600
00:39:14,239 --> 00:39:16,320
Dad, you've pulled this for over ten years.

601
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:17,320
Aren't you tired of it yet?

602
00:39:20,159 --> 00:39:22,519
All right, down to business.

603
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:25,400
Got a big assignment. Want it?

604
00:39:27,239 --> 00:39:28,199
Of course I do.

605
00:39:29,480 --> 00:39:29,920
Good.

606
00:39:32,239 --> 00:39:32,760
Luo Xi.

607
00:39:33,039 --> 00:39:33,599
Wei Tian.

608
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:35,639
We've got a massive commission here.

609
00:39:37,159 --> 00:39:37,960
What are the requirements?

610
00:39:38,400 --> 00:39:40,119
Nothing special, just a high-profile client.

611
00:39:40,400 --> 00:39:41,320
Look, it's signed "M."

612
00:39:42,159 --> 00:39:42,960
Taking it or not?

613
00:39:44,480 --> 00:39:45,400
We can't turn it down.

614
00:39:50,679 --> 00:39:52,079
Why cooperate with the Silent Protectors?

615
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:53,679
Don't we have the ability

616
00:39:53,679 --> 00:39:55,400
to handle this mission on our own?

617
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:58,440
As you know,

618
00:39:59,760 --> 00:40:01,400
our railway project here

619
00:40:01,559 --> 00:40:02,360
was sabotaged

620
00:40:02,360 --> 00:40:04,039
by an unidentified group.

621
00:40:04,920 --> 00:40:06,840
To ensure construction proceeds smoothly,

622
00:40:07,840 --> 00:40:09,079
we commissioned

623
00:40:09,079 --> 00:40:10,719
a very influential local figure

624
00:40:10,719 --> 00:40:11,639
to help us.

625
00:40:12,159 --> 00:40:13,639
And hiring the Silent Protectors

626
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:15,519
was proposed by this person.

627
00:40:16,639 --> 00:40:17,440
But the Silent Protectors

628
00:40:17,440 --> 00:40:19,559
aren't even a professional security firm.

629
00:40:20,119 --> 00:40:21,760
Yet the client requested it.

630
00:40:25,400 --> 00:40:26,559
Since this client

631
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:28,360
distrusts Zhong'an so much,

632
00:40:29,639 --> 00:40:30,000
I don't think

633
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:32,039
there's any need to deal with them further.

634
00:40:33,960 --> 00:40:36,159
Don't be so resistant to the Silent Protectors.

635
00:40:36,599 --> 00:40:37,480
Frankly speaking,

636
00:40:38,159 --> 00:40:40,719
the way they operate here

637
00:40:41,119 --> 00:40:43,599
has a lot that Zhong'an can learn from.

638
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:46,400
You must remember,

639
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:48,840
our goal is to complete the mission flawlessly,

640
00:40:48,840 --> 00:40:51,559
not to compete over who's better.

641
00:40:54,679 --> 00:40:55,119
All right.

642
00:40:56,519 --> 00:40:57,320
Don't worry.

643
00:40:58,400 --> 00:40:59,400
Since we're partnering up,

644
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:01,400
I'll definitely respect them.

645
00:41:03,199 --> 00:41:05,760
Dad, I have one more question.

646
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:08,199
This person who's coming

647
00:41:08,199 --> 00:41:09,159
with the Chinese rail experts,

648
00:41:09,519 --> 00:41:10,599
who is she really?

649
00:41:12,840 --> 00:41:15,440
They call her the African Queen.

650
00:41:16,199 --> 00:41:17,760
You'll meet her tomorrow.

651
00:41:45,840 --> 00:41:46,639
Hello.

652
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:48,760
Captain, why did the African Queen

653
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:50,920
insist on staying at a Chinese hotel?

654
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:51,679
You idiot.

655
00:41:51,679 --> 00:41:52,519
Does King Jose Limon

656
00:41:52,519 --> 00:41:54,039
walk the streets every day?

657
00:41:54,480 --> 00:41:55,519
Don't worry, Captain.

658
00:41:55,519 --> 00:41:57,719
We've got everything taken care of.

659
00:41:58,119 --> 00:41:59,119
Great, great.

660
00:42:00,199 --> 00:42:01,039
All right, all right.

661
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:04,199
Have a blast, boys!

662
00:42:05,199 --> 00:42:07,840
Sissoko knows that woman better than we do.

663
00:42:08,079 --> 00:42:09,800
Since he's willing to take action,

664
00:42:10,440 --> 00:42:13,119
why do you have to do it yourself?

665
00:42:13,119 --> 00:42:14,960
Is there anyone in Antilocaris

666
00:42:15,519 --> 00:42:17,760
who knows the Silent Protectors better than me?

667
00:42:19,039 --> 00:42:20,119
Only by doing this

668
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:22,840
can we show true respect to our rivals.

669
00:42:56,599 --> 00:42:57,960
Our distinguished guest,

670
00:42:57,960 --> 00:42:59,320
welcome, welcome.

671
00:42:59,320 --> 00:43:00,840
I'm Xiao Chuan, the hotel manager.

672
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:01,519
It's an absolute honor

673
00:43:01,519 --> 00:43:03,719
to have you stay at our Plato Hotel.

674
00:43:04,199 --> 00:43:06,239
On behalf of all our staff,

675
00:43:06,239 --> 00:43:08,480
I extend our warmest welcome to you.

676
00:43:08,880 --> 00:43:10,199
Hello, I'm Anda.

677
00:43:10,199 --> 00:43:12,159
I'm the assistant director of housekeeping.

678
00:43:12,360 --> 00:43:14,079
Your room is all ready.

679
00:43:14,079 --> 00:43:14,639
Right this way.

680
00:43:14,639 --> 00:43:16,119
I don't like anyone walking ahead of me.

681
00:43:16,119 --> 00:43:16,639
Quickly, move.

682
00:43:16,639 --> 00:43:18,079
This is Antilocaris.

683
00:43:18,360 --> 00:43:20,039
If you don't keep a clear line of sight,

684
00:43:20,039 --> 00:43:21,599
you could be ambushed at any moment.

685
00:43:22,119 --> 00:43:22,800
Right, right, of course.

686
00:43:22,800 --> 00:43:25,639
If there's anything you need,

687
00:43:25,639 --> 00:43:26,760
please don't hesitate to let us know.

688
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:28,840
We'll do our best to accommodate you.
